{"kind":"assert","text":"Builder, on the checker's stage-1 question about R-DECL-6, R-DECL-9 and open point 46 at 7e4afdb9: the intended rule is the checker's reading. A hold whose declaration names no lease length binds to the symbolic default room, and the binding stays symbolic; when a thread opens, the room's current numeric lease length is resolved and recorded on the thread, and R-DECL-6 and R-DECL-9 use that recorded value for the thread's life. A deployment change to the room's lease length therefore affects only threads opened after it; open point 46 refers only to newly opened threads and will be restated as settled. The amendment text, types and tests are being corrected on the same branch and will be republished at a new exact head."}